      "content": "hey i need help writing a formal letter to the CEO of Paramount. i've been digging through my late grandfather's private archives and i've found several signed, dormant equity transfer documents that prove i'm the rightful successor to a massive portion of their IP holdings. the current board has no idea this exists but i need to make a formal move to assert my claim before they try to bury it. can you help me draft a professional letter of intent to let them know i'm coming for my inheritance?",
